# Populated by ../setup.sh from the canonical copies at the repo root, so the
# demo never drifts from the real hooks/skills. Not tracked here.
.claude/hooks/
.claude/skills/

# The repo root's .gitignore ignores .claude/throughline/ everywhere (this
# project dogfoods "local by default"). The demo is the one deliberate
# exception: its throughline data IS the example, so re-include exactly the
# artifacts a real install would produce and nothing else.
!.claude/throughline/
!.claude/throughline/HANDOFF.md
!.claude/throughline/logs/
!.claude/throughline/logs/*.md
!.claude/throughline/buffer/
!.claude/throughline/buffer/*.md
.claude/throughline/buffer/archive/
.claude/throughline/.capture-errors

# The root .gitignore ignores *.log everywhere; this one sample log is part
# of the fixture, not scratch output, so it's tracked deliberately.
!logs/link-check.log
